[Input Directories]
      ├── /src_scss/ (Raw, messy SCSS)
      └── /src_html/ (Unbranded components)
             │
             ▼
     [Analyzer / Refactorer Engine]
             │
             ├──► Extract Discrepancies
             ├──► Generate Generic Tokens ($color-extracted-1)
             └──► Generate Shared Partials
             │
             ▼
   [Visual Audit Generator] ──► Generates visual_audit_vX.html
             │
             ▼
     [Human-in-the-Loop] (Via Browser)
      ├── Views HTML Sandbox rendered natively.
      └── Maps tokens in Resolution Studio UI.
             │
             ▼
   [resolution_map.json] (Saved to /config_data/)
             │
             ▼
     [Rewriter Daemon] (Triggered by pressing 'r')
             │
             ├──► Searches /src_scss/ for raw values, replaces with mapped $tokens.
             ├──► Searches /src_html/ for raw values, replaces with inline var(--tokens).
             │
             ▼
     [Output Directory]
      └── /output_applied/ (Production-Ready Architecture)